## Scope

This license applies to the application code and structure only: everything
under `app/`, `components/`, `lib/`, `models/`, `scripts/`, `services/`, and
config files — the parts anyone could reuse to build their own site on the
same foundation.

It does **not** apply to the personal content and media that populate this
particular site, including but not limited to:

- the data in `content/*.ts` (profile, timeline, credentials, toolbox,
  site copy)
- photos, portraits, and video under `public/` (including the legacy
  `/nyc-images` and `/drone-video` media)
- the generated CV PDF(s) (`public/cv*.pdf`)
- the `lore-le` name and any personal branding

That content is © 2026 Lorenzo Lettieri. All rights reserved — it may not be
copied, redistributed, or reused without permission, regardless of the
license granted above for the surrounding code.
